e_item_assets/steam/apps/2804680/extras/0c53ea05521a71074a25550abae0b6d1.mp4?t=1749786889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83d\ude3a Feline Agility: Take control of this lost lil kitty cat and use their agile movement and feline reflexes to gracefully navigate through tight spaces, make daring jumps and gracefully land on narrow surfaces. It's all about finesse and precision!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804680/extras/83eb4fc42c53f675c1ac1eaf9661634a.poster.avif?t=1749786889\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804680/extras/83eb4fc42c53f675c1ac1eaf9661634a.webm?t=1749786889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804680/extras/83eb4fc42c53f675c1ac1eaf9661634a.mp4?t=1749786889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Dazzling Skyline: Immerse yourself in a vibrant and seemingly endless cityscape as you descend. Watch the city blend into the horizon and marvel at the stunning views that unfold as you make your way down the towering skyscrapers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804680/extras/3ccc7c03e6f082d778278514161787a5.poster.avif?t=1749786889\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804680/extras/3ccc7c03e6f082d778278514161787a5.webm?t=1749786889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804680/extras/3ccc7c03e6f082d778278514161787a5.mp4?t=1749786889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Set out on a paw-some escapade with this lil kitty cat and experience the thrill of descending skyscrapers in this feline-filled adventure. Only Way is Down is not just a game; it's a formidable journey that will leave you purring for more! Are you ready to take the plunge and find your way back home.",
    "short_description": "Embark on a purrfectly perilous rage filled adventure as this lil kitty cat took an unfortunate catnap and ended up stranded sky high! With no way but down, master your feline agility and platforming prowess to navigate your descent through the urban jungle in this gravity defying escapade!",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Portuguese - Brazil, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Norwegian, Romanian, Swedish, Traditional Chinese, Serbian",
    "reviews": "\u201cIf you love cats and like rage-quit style games that gives you a set number of lives to try and reach a seemingly unfathomable task, to reach the bottom, then you\u2019ll love what ONLY WAY IS DOWN has to offer\u201d<br>8.5/10 \u2013 Horror Cult Films<br><br>\u201cThe game\u2019s charm, customization, and engaging mechanics make it a fun choice for cat lovers and platforming enthusiasts alike\u201d<br>7.5/10 \u2013 El Bot\u00f3n A<br><br>\u201cOnly way is Down is een leuke game die je aardig wat uitdaging biedt. Vooral voor de speedrunners kan deze game een leuke uitdaging zijn\u201d<br>7.5/10 \u2013 GameQuarter<br>",
